197	    // r18 m04rfew: telescoping rings — every ring is a copy of the template ring scaled by vF.y about a centre on the
198	    // water line; angle and radius are taken around the ring's OWN centre, in template units, and the position along
199	    // the ring comes from the ring coordinate (painted-period units), so texture, lip, groove and dots shrink with it
200	    float sF = max(vF.y, 1e-3);
